{
 "about": "P46F T3: the overnight list in the order it is generated, by impact on play – (1) bosses, one stream per P46B genre interleaved (runner chaser, driving machine over the track, platformer end boss, track-guarding machine), (2) things for P46A actions interleaved (weapons and projectiles, shields, power-ups, loot), (3) enemies and obstacles, (4) small creatures. Within a group by `sentences` (demand corpus, P37A dev set, P45 panel without its P30 rows; noun or alias), then by hand. Every name and alias is free of the class words of scripts/assets/p32-manifest.mjs, so a promoted model never changes the pinned src/play manifest; a foe, chaser or boss still picks it by catalog tag. class: scripts/p37d/gen-list.mjs entryOf (ray guns by hand). Features in ops/gen3d/features.toml. Rounds in D:/caches/p46f/round<n>/list.json; the loop writes round 2+ (a retry round with seeds a2,b2,a3 once 10 names wait for their one retry).",
